Wikipedia for HarmonyOS
=======================

This project is an unofficial HarmonyOS (ArkTS / ArkUI) port of the Wikipedia
iOS app, the official Wikipedia reader for iPhone and iPad by the Wikimedia
Foundation and its contributors.

Upstream project: https://github.com/wikimedia/wikipedia-ios
Upstream base:    release 2026.08.11, build 6144 (tag releases/2026.08.11)

The upstream software is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in the
LICENSE file at the root of this repository:

    Copyright (c) 2013–2025 Wikimedia Foundation et al.

This port reuses upstream source logic, strings, resources and artwork. All of it
remains under that MIT License. Modifications made for the HarmonyOS platform are
released under the same terms.

This port is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the Wikimedia
Foundation. Please do not report problems with this port to the upstream
project. "Wikipedia", the Wikipedia puzzle globe and the Wikipedia wordmark are
trademarks of the Wikimedia Foundation; the MIT License covers the source code,
not those names or that artwork.


Content and services
--------------------

Articles, images and other content shown in the app are loaded at run time from
Wikipedia, Wikimedia Commons and Wikidata. Text is available under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike License (CC BY-SA 4.0); media carries the license
shown on its own file page. None of that content ships in this repository.

The Places map is Huawei Map Kit (Petal Maps). Its map data and attribution are
provided, and shown on the map, by that service under Huawei's terms.


